WEBVTT

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:04.550
The stage that breaks boundaries!

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.250
Top Clear Mind!

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.290
What?

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:16.730
C'mon!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.500
T.G. Halberd Cannon!

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.310
What's this?

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:27.080
Yusei!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.760
See that?

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.850
I Synchro Summoned using three Synchro Monsters.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:34.610
This is the Synchro beyond Accel Synchro!

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.580
It's Delta Accel Synchro!

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.050
Delta Accel Synchro?

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:47.240
A black hole that swallows up 
the light is about to be created.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:52.090
It swallows and erases everything.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.040
It is the end of everything.

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:58.500
And your world is also coming to an end!

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:03.610
T.G. Halberd Cannon attacks 
Shooting Star Dragon!

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.830
Shooting Star Dragon's effect activates!

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:26.130
It can be removed from play 
once per opponent's turn.

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:28.700
Are you sure about that?

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.530
What?

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:43.310
What's going on?

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:48.780
When your monster leaves the 
field due to an effect,

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:53.290
Halberd Cannon negates that effect, 
and your monster loses 800 attack points.

00:01:53.910 --> 00:01:59.530
Even Shooting Star can't escape from the 
Delta Accel Synchro Monster Halberd Cannon.

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:02.600
There is no way to escape!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.100
Vanish, Shooting Star Dragon!

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:09.200
I activate the Continuous Trap
Enduring Soul!

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:13.240
My monster in attack position
won't be destroyed in battle!

00:02:14.720 --> 00:02:16.520
You think that stopped it?

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.650
You still take damage, Yusei.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:26.120
The monster that used this 
effect loses 800 attack points.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:32.170
Yusei, you only have 100 life points left.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.400
By surpassing my limits,
this is the difference in our power!

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:36.680
I end my turn!

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:43.640
Riding Duels.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.720
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:53.320
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:55.260 --> 00:03:01.360
Run! The road of evolution leading to tomorrow

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:05.900
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:22.860
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:28.480
Set free your infinite potential

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:34.090
Every beginning is up to you

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:40.700
Everyone is lost Pursue the light

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:46.000
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:51.570
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:59.420
Become the gale and dance Cut through the darkness

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:04.610
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:10.090
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:15.960
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:23.490
Going my way!! Break through and go!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:43.020
Faster than Light!!

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.400
Is it safe?

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:57.850
There's no one around-

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:59.570
Hey, what are you doing?

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.960
Yusei is still battling.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:28.230
Who's the enemy?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:29.990
Yusei...

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:37.500
I wonder if Yusei is okay.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.780
Of course he's okay!

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:42.250
Yusei will definitely...

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:43.050
Yeah.

00:05:43.050 --> 00:05:46.760
No matter what happens, 
he will definitely come!

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.260
My turn!

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.820
I summon Sonic Chick in defense position!

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:04.260
A monster with at least 1900 attack 
points can't destroy it in battle!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:05.530
That's pointless.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:06.100
What?

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.960
Due to Halberd Cannon's effect,

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:12.080
your monster summoning 
is negated and destroyed.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:14.250
It can use this effect 
the same number of times

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:16.480
as the monsters that were 
used to Synchro Summon it.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.210
Negate the summoning of a monster?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.810
Close Summon!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.520
What a powerful monster.

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:33.390
Even if I summon new monsters, 
they will just be destroyed.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:34.860
There's nothing I can do.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:39.480
The only thing you can do is switch 
Shooting Star Dragon to defense position.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:44.810
But if you do that, Enduring Soul's effect 
can't protect it from destruction.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.540
What will you do, Yusei?

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:52.510
I set one card and end my turn!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:56.600
So you left Shooting Star in attack position.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:00.280
That means your set card has 
an effect that lessens damage

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:03.620
or an effect that counters 
Halberd Cannon's attack.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.850
That's what I would usually think.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.160
But since I'm dealing with you...

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:11.460
You must have expected 
that I would think that.

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:16.430
That's why that card may be a bluff 
to stop me from attacking.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.580
My turn!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:23.810
Cheap tricks don't work against me!

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:27.040
I activate the trap Magnetic Storm!

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:30.700
It destroys one spell or 
trap card on your field,

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:34.250
and you can't activate a spell 
or trap card at this time.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:36.950
I destroy your set card!

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:44.170
When a monster is destroyed in battle, 
Revenge Return lets you draw one card.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:45.630
I knew it was a bluff.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.830
Yusei, you have 100 life points left.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.300
This is the end!

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:54.270
Halberd Cannon attacks Shooting Star!

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:57.230
Shooting Star's effect activates!

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:00.980
Once per opponent's turn, it can be 
removed from play to negate your attack!

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.010
That's pointless.

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:07.000
There is no way to escape Halberd Cannon!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.040
You don't know when to give up!

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:17.490
This is the end, Yusei!

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:21.180
Halberd Cannon attacks 
Shooting Star Dragon!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.680
I don't think so!

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:26.170
I activate Devoted Gardna's 
effect from my hand!

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:31.070
When you attack a monster with 
1000 or fewer attack points,

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.450
by sending this card in 
my hand to the graveyard,

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.380
I take 0 damage!

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.510
Enduring Soul's effect activates!

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:44.920
Shooting Star isn't destroyed in battle, 
and it loses 800 attack points!

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.800
I see.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.480
In order to activate Devoted 
Gardna's effect,

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:03.270
he wanted Halberd Cannon's effect to 
lower Shooting Star's attack points below 1000.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.000
Impressive, Yusei.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.960
I was right about you.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:07.540
However...

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:12.250
Shooting Star's attack points and 
your life points are both 100.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.100
You have no cards in your hand, 
so what will you do?

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.820
He's strong.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:20.440
This is the power of 
his Delta Accel Synchro.

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:24.830
He also knows my strategies too well.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.580
If things don't change,
I can't do anything.

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:41.480
Black hole.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:45.110
This will definitely be our final field.

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:50.950
You will lose, and that black 
darkness will swallow you.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:57.830
I end my turn.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.620
So this is my death 
that Sherry foretold.

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:09.320
Yusei!

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.170
You can't change the future.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:14.810
That's not true!

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:19.580
I came here to change destiny and the future!

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:22.810
Everyone believes that, so I...

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:30.150
I will defeat you and open the path!

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.190
Let's go, Shooting Star Dragon!

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.330
Yusei!

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.030
Do your best!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.240
No matter what happens...

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:49.940
You must...

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:53.640
Come to us, Yusei!

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:59.120
I will never give up!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:04.580
My turn!

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:08.810
I activate Speed Spell - 
Angel Baton from my hand!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.310
When I have 2 or more Speed Counters,

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.020
I draw two cards from my deck,

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:15.630
and I send one card in 
my hand to the graveyard.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:20.800
I send Necro Defender to the graveyard
 and Special Summon Wild Heart!

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:28.010
I can Special Summon Wild Heart when I 
send a monster in my hand to the graveyard.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:31.480
What's the point of summoning
a monster with 1000 attack points?

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:33.600
I see.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:34.950
Nice idea, Yusei.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.750
Wild Heart has two effects.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:41.600
The first lets it attack the 
opponent directly and self-destruct.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:45.930
The other effect Special Summons it
when another card destroys it.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:51.620
And Shooting Star Dragon negates and 
destroys effects that destroy cards.

00:11:51.970 --> 00:11:56.800
So if Shooting Star negates Wild Heart's
self-destruction and destroys it,

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:01.120
Wild Heart resurrects and can attack 
directly, creating an infinite loop combo.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:05.400
Despite this dire situation,
you created an impressive combo.

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:07.710
But do you think I would let you do that?

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:10.840
Halberd Cannon's effect activates!

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:13.320
Wild Heart won't be Special Summoned!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:14.490
Close Summon!

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:22.800
If Wild Heart isn't summoned, 
its effect can't activate.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.870
You've run out of options.

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:32.410
I'm only getting started!

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:33.610
I activate a trap from my graveyard!

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.070
Revenge Return!

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.640
It's the card I destroyed before.

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:38.810
I see.

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:43.560
Revenge Return has another effect that 
can activate when it's in the graveyard.

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:46.330
By removing this card in 
the graveyard from play,

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:50.480
I can Special Summon a monster that was sent to 
the graveyard by an effect this turn.

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:51.880
I remove Revenge Return from play!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.510
I Special Summon Wild Heart!

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:57.690
It's pointless!

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:00.870
Halberd Cannon's effect 
negates the Special Summoning!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:02.030
Close Summon!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.080
This effect can be used
 the same number of times

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:09.500
as the monsters that were 
used to Synchro Summon it.

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:13.210
So Halberd Cannon can use this effect
three times, and you used them up!

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:14.100
That's right.

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:17.840
But you have no cards in your 
hand or any set cards.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.420
What more can you do?

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:25.090
It's true that I don't have a monster that can surpass 
 Accel Synchro, like your Delta Accel Synchro.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:32.300
But you taught me that as long as I believe 
in my potential, I can overcome my limits!

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:34.310
To challenge my limits!

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:37.400
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:42.350
I remove 7 Speed Counters to draw one card.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:45.000
This card is my light of hope!

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:46.710
It's here!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.050
I summon Balance Blaster!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:02.330
I now have all the cards I need to win!

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:06.460
I remove Necro Defender in my graveyard 
from play to activate its effect!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:08.970
I now take 0 damage.

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:13.820
And due to Enduring Soul's effect,
Shooting Star isn't destroyed!

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:17.550
Shooting Star has 100 attack points.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:20.430
If it attacks Halberd Cannon 
that has 4000 attack points,

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:22.410
I won't take damage, nor will 
my monster be destroyed.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:24.580
The battle will be pointless.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:30.050
You forgot about Enduring Soul and 
Balance Blaster's other effects.

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:33.180
Enduring Soul's effect 
prevents a monster's destruction

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.570
in battle by lowering 
its attack points by 800.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:39.900
But your Shooting Star 
has 100 attack points.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.660
You can't decrease it by 800.

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:42.870
Are you sure about that?

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:47.960
Balance Blaster's effect prevents 
Shooting Star's attack points from changing,

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:52.040
and the amount it should have changed 
is dealt to you as damage.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:56.170
In other words, if Shooting 
Star attacks Halberd Cannon,

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:59.310
you take 800 points of damage.

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:00.780
800...

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:04.520
And Shooting Star can attack multiple times!

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.320
Shooting Star's effect activates!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:18.350
I check the top five cards 
in my deck, and it can attack

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:21.200
once for every Tuner Monster I find.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.600
I have 1800 life points.

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.610
If you attack me three times, 
I will have 0 life points.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:31.300
But that will only happen if you find three 
Tuners among your five cards.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:36.720
It's a miracle that you can even try this,
but you think you can surpass it?

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.100
I will surpass it!

00:15:38.360 --> 00:15:40.150
Surpass my potential!

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:41.690
Surpass my limits!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.220
The first card!

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:48.590
Tuner Monster Turbo Synchron!

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:51.130
The second card!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:55.580
The third card!

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.970
The second Tuner Nitro Synchron!

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:01.810
The fourth card!

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:12.540
Yusei!

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:16.700
We'll soon be trapped in the 
black hole's gravitational field.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:21.950
If we enter the accretion disc's 
 Schwarzschild radius,

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:24.100
even light can't escape.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.960
If your next card isn't aTuner,

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:32.770
you will be destroyed into particles
 and vanish from existence!

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:37.010
This is the end.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:48.620
The fifth card!

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:54.990
All right!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.060
The third Tuner Hyper Synchron!

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.510
Impossible!

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.560
You can attack three times?

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:04.780
Shooting Star Dragon attacks Halberd Cannon!

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:12.640
Stardust Mirage!

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:26.090
Go!

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:34.630
This is your...

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:36.110
That's right!

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.870
You taught me the power
to surpass my limits!

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:40.570
Yusei...

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:55.420
Antinomy!

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:05.280
Even light can't escape
from this space.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.700
Are you okay, Antinomy?

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:19.370
Yusei, I saw your potential.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.280
Yusei, save this world!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:24.250
What?

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:27.980
Save this world and save Z-one!

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:29.610
What do you mean?

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:33.220
Weren't you fighting 
to destroy this world?

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.590
During the time I spent with you,

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:40.500
I've seen you do the
impossible over and over.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:44.970
So when I regained my 
memories, I made a decision.

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:47.930
To believe in Yusei's potential!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:49.900
My potential?

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.570
You can definitely do it!

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:59.450
I know you can break your limits!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:03.780
So I started this duel 
to guide you to a new power!

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:05.750
Which is Delta Accel!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:11.790
Yusei, I know you can find 
your own Delta Accel!

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.630
So you did all this
to inform me about that?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.160
Yusei, I wish I could have met you 
under different circumstances.

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:23.880
If so, we could have become true friends.

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:25.870
Antinomy- I mean, Bruno!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:31.610
You're a member of Team 5D's
and my friend, Bruno!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:36.230
Friend...

00:19:37.510 --> 00:19:41.490
I'm your friend, Yusei?

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:45.780
Friend...

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:50.600
I loved cheering for everyone

00:19:50.600 --> 00:19:54.650
and watching them battle
alongside you, Yusei.

00:19:57.060 --> 00:20:01.270
Because I felt your infinite 
power and potential.

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:03.140
Bruno...

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:08.580
Bruno, jump over!  Hurry!

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:10.310
It's pointless.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.660
I told you.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:16.890
One of us has to vanish in order 
to escape from this course.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:18.620
Bruno!

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:22.960
The time I spent with
you all was the best.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:24.560
Bruno...

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.430
What are you doing, Bruno?

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:34.300
Yusei, you're my hope!

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:36.270
Accel Synchro surpasses light!

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:40.240
Surpass the light and open the future!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.300
Go, Yusei!

00:20:53.590 --> 00:20:55.090
Bruno!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:56.680
Yusei...

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:02.630
Bruno!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:42.800
Bruno...

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:45.780
Bruno!

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:11.700
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:11.930 --> 00:22:17.070
If we shed the same tears, let's laugh together

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:22.440
Freed reality forms phrases in the piercing beat

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:25.210
Our hearts resonate

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:30.420
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:30.420 --> 00:22:37.020
We'll find a place for us

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:44.130
Waking in a dream Stretch our hands toward the future

00:22:44.130 --> 00:22:49.170
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:55.340
Repaint the darkness with the colors we envision

00:22:55.340 --> 00:23:03.650
Overlaying memories, bonds and hope creates future color

00:23:03.650 --> 00:23:09.550
We will draw it forever
